sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor K as Kunde or Gaest
    participant PM as PaymentModel
    participant CS as ICartStore
    participant OS as SqlOrderStore
    participant SC as ShippingCalculator
    participant DB as MarsvinDb
    participant SE as Session
    participant ES as IEmailSender
    participant CF as ConfirmationModel

    Note over PM,DB: As built. No payment provider is contacted - the card or MobilePay<br/>choice is stored on the order, and card details are only checked for shape.<br/>No account is needed: ICartStore is the database cart for a Customer<br/>and the session cart for a guest.

    K->>PM: POST /Cart/Payment (name + email if guest, phone, buyer type,<br/>company + CVR, age box, delivery, address, carrier,<br/>paymentMethod, card fields)
    Note over PM: Public page, but Employee and Admin<br/>are turned away - staff accounts cannot buy.
    PM->>CS: GetLines(userId)
    CS-->>PM: CartLine list (live prices and weights)

    alt cart empty
        PM-->>K: Redirect to /Cart
    else something that applies is missing or malformed
        Note over PM: Only what applies is required: guest name + email,<br/>phone and address if Shipping, age box if an animal,<br/>company name + CVR check digit if Company,<br/>card digits if Card (spaces and slash optional).
        PM-->>K: Page() with the fields marked
    else valid
        PM->>OS: Checkout(userId or null, delivery, address, carrier, paymentMethod,<br/>guestName, guestEmail, guestLines, phone, ageConfirmed, company, cvr, placedInEnglish)
        OS->>DB: BeginTransaction
        OS->>DB: SELECT CartItems JOIN Products / Animals / StockProducts
        DB-->>OS: lines with DB prices and weights
        Note over OS: A guest has no CartItems rows, so the lines<br/>PaymentModel already resolved are passed in<br/>and re-validated against the database below.

        alt cart empty
            OS-->>PM: Fail("Din kurv er tom")
        else Shipping but all lines are animals, or no address
            OS->>DB: Rollback
            OS-->>PM: Fail(reason)
            Note over OS: Re-checked here, never trusted from the form
        else
            loop each cart line
                OS->>DB: SELECT ... WITH (UPDLOCK, HOLDLOCK)
                Note over OS,DB: Animal: Status = Available and at least 4 weeks old.<br/>StockProduct: StockQuantity >= qty.<br/>The lock stops two checkouts racing for the last unit.
            end

            alt any line invalid
                OS->>DB: Rollback
                OS-->>PM: Fail(reason)
            else all lines valid
                opt Shipping
                    OS->>SC: Quote(carrier, weight of the shippable lines, today, their total)
                    SC-->>OS: cost, parcel count (max 20 kg each)
                    Note over OS,SC: The form chooses a carrier - never a price.<br/>Free when the shipped accessories reach 2,000 kr.
                end
                OS->>DB: INSERT Orders (Status = Placed, TotalPrice = DB prices + shipping,<br/>ShippingCost / WeightGrams / ParcelCount snapshots,<br/>guest name + email or UserId, phone, age, company, PlacedInEnglish)
                OS->>DB: INSERT OrderItems (ProductName, UnitPrice, IsAnimal snapshots)
                loop each cart line
                    OS->>DB: Animal to Sold, or StockQuantity = StockQuantity - qty
                end
                OS->>DB: DELETE CartItems for this user
                OS->>DB: Commit
                OS-->>PM: Ok(order)
                PM->>CS: Clear(userId)
                opt guest
                    PM->>SE: SetInt32("GuestOrderId", orderId)
                    Note over PM,SE: The guest's receipt pass: only this browser's<br/>session ever holds this order id.
                end
                PM->>ES: SendAsync("Ordrebekraeftelse" or "Order confirmation")
                Note over PM,ES: Written in the language the order was placed in:<br/>the marsvin-lang cookie of this request, saved on the order.
                PM-->>K: Redirect to /Cart/Confirmation/{orderId}
                K->>CF: GET /Cart/Confirmation/{orderId}
                alt signed in
                    CF->>OS: FindForUser(orderId, userId)
                    Note over CF,OS: Takes both ids, so changing orderId in the URL<br/>to someone else's order just returns 404 (no IDOR).
                else guest
                    CF->>SE: GetInt32("GuestOrderId") == orderId?
                    CF->>OS: FindById(orderId), only on a match
                end
                CF-->>K: receipt: status steps, delivery, expected delivery,<br/>pickup note if an animal is in a shipped order
            end
        end
        PM-->>K: on Fail: Redirect to /Cart with the error message
    end

    Note over OS,DB: One transaction covers validation, shipping price, insert,<br/>stock change and cart clear - any failure rolls the whole thing back.
